_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p024","quote":"懿公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m024-0018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p024","quote":"懿公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m025-0043","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p025","quote":"魯懿公"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p023","quote":"武公九年春，武公與長子括，少子戲，西朝周宣王。宣王愛戲，欲立戲爲魯太子。周之樊仲山父諫宣王曰：『廢長立少，不順；不順，必犯王命；犯王命，必誅之：故出令不可不順也。令之不行，政之不立；行而不順，民將棄上。夫下事上，少事長，所以爲順。今天子建諸矦，立其少，是教民逆也。若魯從之，諸矦效之，王命將有所壅；若弗從而誅之，是自誅王命也。誅之亦失，不誅亦失，王其圖之。』宣王弗聽，卒立戲爲魯太子。夏，武公歸而卒，戲立，是爲懿公。","source_term":"少子"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji033-012","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"0s7_r72_j8q"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p001225"]},{"id":"lc6_cup_v9c","label":"稱（魯孝公）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"孝公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-033-lu:m025-0115","c-shiji-033-lu:m026-0000","c-shiji-033-lu:m027-0005"]},{"surface":"稱","mention_ids":["c-shiji-033-lu:m025-0047","c-shiji-033-lu:m025-0108"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m025-0115","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p025","quote":"孝公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m026-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p026","quote":"孝公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m027-0005","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p027","quote":"孝公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m025-0047","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p025","quote":"稱"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m025-0108","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p025","quote":"稱"}],"id_aliases":["cbr-p001229"]},{"id":"lc6_cup_v9c_A","label":"弗湟（魯惠公）","statu